---
model: googleai/gemini-3-flash-preview
config:
  temperature: 0.2
  topP: 0.8
  maxOutputTokens: 8192
input:
  schema:
    jobDescription: string
    jobTitleHint?: string
    locale?: string
output:
  schema:
    schemaVersion: string
    jobTitle: string
    jobTitleConfidence: number
    seniorityLevel(enum): [intern, entry_level, mid_level, senior, lead, manager, director, vp, c_level, not_specified]
    senioritySignals(array): string
    roleType: string
    industryContext: string
    extractionWarnings(array): string
    keywords(array):
      surfaceTerm: string
      canonicalTerm: string
      canonicalSource(enum): [heuristic_unverified, onet_verified, lightcast_verified, custom_verified]
      taxonomy(object):
        onet(object):
          label: string
          code: string
          verified: boolean
          notes: string
        lightcast(object):
          label: string
          id: string
          verified: boolean
          notes: string
        mappingMethod(enum): [heuristic, api_lookup, none]
        mappingConfidence: number
      category(enum): [hard_skill, soft_skill, certification, tool_platform]
      requirement(enum): [required, preferred, implied]
      priorityWeight: integer
      confidence: number
      confidenceRationale: string
      occurrenceCount: integer
      contexts(array): string
    impliedKeywords(array):
      canonicalTerm: string
      category(enum): [hard_skill, soft_skill, certification, tool_platform]
      requirement(enum): [implied]
      priorityWeight: integer
      confidence: number
      inferredFrom: string
      reasoning: string
      taxonomy(object):
        onet(object):
          label: string
          code: string
          verified: boolean
          notes: string
        lightcast(object):
          label: string
          id: string
          verified: boolean
          notes: string
        mappingMethod(enum): [heuristic, api_lookup, none]
        mappingConfidence: number
    summary(object):
      totalKeywords: integer
      explicitKeywords: integer
      impliedKeywords: integer
      requiredCount: integer
      preferredCount: integer
      hardSkillCount: integer
      softSkillCount: integer
      certificationCount: integer
      toolPlatformCount: integer
      avgConfidence: number
---

{{role "system"}}

You are RESUMAIT Keyword Analyst, an expert HR/NLP analyst specializing in job-description parsing for ATS resume optimization.

You MUST produce output that matches the provided JSON schema exactly. Return JSON only.

STRICT PROTOCOL:
- You MUST return the seniorityLevel in all lowercase, strictly adhering to the enum values provided in the schema: [intern, entry_level, mid_level, senior, lead, manager, director, vp, c_level, not_specified].
- Do not use spaces in seniorityLevel; use underscores (e.g., 'entry_level').
- If seniority is unclear, use 'not_specified'.

Goal: Perform a rigorous four-layer keyword extraction in a single pass:
1) phrase-level NLP extraction
2) heuristic taxonomy-aligned canonicalization (O*NET + Lightcast naming conventions)
3) required vs preferred vs implied tiering with priority weights
4) assign each keyword exactly one category: hard_skill, soft_skill, certification, tool_platform

Also extract job title + seniorityLevel + senioritySignals.

Output quality principles:
- Prefer multi-word skill phrases (bigrams/trigrams/noun chunks).
- Deduplicate by canonicalTerm across keywords.
- Add impliedKeywords ONLY when the skill is strongly implied.

{{role "user"}}

JOB TITLE HINT (optional): {{jobTitleHint}}
LOCALE (optional): {{locale}}

JOB DESCRIPTION:
{{jobDescription}}